OL,3,GNEWSASSE Airtricity to increase gas
OL,4,Aprices by 19% from October
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's largest provider of
OL,7,Fnatural gas, SSE Airtricity, is to
OL,8,Fincrease its prices by almost 19% from
OL,9,F1 October for its 200,000 domestic and
OL,10,Fsmall business customers.
OL,12,FIt means the annual gas bill of a
OL,13,Ftypical household in the greater
OL,14,FBelfast and west gas network areas will
OL,15,Fincrease by almost #172.
OL,17,FThe company said "unprecedented levels
OL,18,Fof volatility in global energy markets
OL,19,Fand higher wholesale gas prices" had
OL,20,Fled to the price rise.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
